vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jJRepI8RRY4Q7kNvwGwgPmz&_nc_oc=AdngJonTuC7ol_8d_dXJp5uJK5Xkh3ZvcSVv6CgY-2hv4Uu6J-HJoQ0MJLmKF7h1nW0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxE2kg5DHPEK2PwhhL4UyJPqoEZ1ZfE6P7JgvvNRd0H9w&oe=69AD73D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jgf-xL0FgZcQ7kNvwGvJyw5&_nc_oc=Adndz5rQFLIQq4JMLAARRxosOl6gSVtNHBuy5Yu7trcBPPmTmtnIwpZwDqr18Tgggis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz3XDpLhAGy_O1PQjaK7uCW6UOqoGdF4T30xZC7qTrcoQ&oe=69AD78B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hRyXJe-mMmUQ7kNvwGmknWn&_nc_oc=AdlROnZ5nNZPIqnSt5sBc8h7A9AXr_0OBSugEQNLTagWL7zoWBjK2hET3rcbHJVoF0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwu_Dt4y7C4-ekNTMLv2DfYUA96x8Nza8rCbwjybBU1NA&oe=69AD8655"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "